{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-relevance","title":"Enduring Relevance","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"mind-and-action-today","title":"知行合一的当代价值","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance/mind-and-action-today","wordCount":1770,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"global-interest","title":"走向世界的心学","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/wang-yangming/influence-and-legacy/enduring-relevance/global-interest","wordCount":1742,"readingTime":7}],"introMarkdown":"本章呈现王阳明心学的当代价值与世界意义。在今天这个知行脱节、心为物役的时代，\"知行合一\"对知行脱节是有力的针砭，\"致良知\"为道德重建提供资源，心学为焦虑的心灵提供安顿的智慧。同时，王阳明的心学，作为东亚的共同遗产，正日益引起西方的关注，以其普遍的人类价值，走向世界。本章揭示王阳明智慧跨越时空、历久弥新的生命力。\n"}